        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "bbcdc3f0-9bfd-5c42-bb56-ea44212dbefe",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Marie Fredriksson, Bada, Per Gessle\n- Music groups: Roxette\n- Albums: I en tid som vår, Made In Sea\n- Roles: singer-songwriter, pianist, musical actress\n- Places: Sweden, South Korea\n\nFacts:\n- Marie Fredriksson was born on 30 May 1958 and was a Swedish pop singer-songwriter and pianist.\n- Bada, whose birth name is Choi Sung-hee, was born on February 28, 1980 and is a South Korean singer and musical actress.\n- Marie Fredriksson and Per Gessle created the pop rock duo Roxette in 1986.\n- Marie Fredriksson is best known as one half of Roxette.\n- I en tid som vår is the fifth album by Swedish pop singer and songwriter Marie Fredriksson.\n- Made In Sea is the third album by South Korean singer Bada and was released on January 26, 2006.",
